  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New rule LC045 (Missing Include): flags navigation properties read from materialized query results that the query never eagerly loaded — the classic read-side N+1 under lazy-loading proxies, or a silent null/empty collection without them. Ships with a code fix that inserts .Include()/.ThenInclude() before the materializer (FixAll supported) and conservative escape analysis to keep false positives at zero. Also fixes the Include-path parsing shared with LC006: mid-path casts and null-forgiving operators (o.Customer!.Address) now parse as the full navigation path instead of a silently truncated segment.",
